{
  "title": "The Flaming Red from Tomorrow",
  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mbox stub\" style=\"border-left-width:8px;margin-bottom:5px;border-left-color:#d6d6d6;position:relative;display:flex;border-radius:3px;border:1px solid #d6d6d6;min-height:32px\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\" style=\"display:table;padding:8px 15px;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;image mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-mbox\" style=\"text-align:center;padding-right:15px;display:table-cell;height:100%;vertical-align:middle;width:40px\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/e/e8/Baizhi_Sticker_Slice_of_Life_01_08.png/revision/latest?cb=20240703174053\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Baizhi Sticker Slice of Life 01 08\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/e/e8/Baizhi_Sticker_Slice_of_Life_01_08.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/65?cb=20240703174053\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"65\" height=\"65\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Baizhi Sticker Slice of Life 01 08.png\" data-image-key=\"Baizhi_Sticker_Slice_of_Life_01_08.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span></div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\" style=\"display:table-cell;vertical-align:middle\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\" style=\"display:block;font-weight:bold\">This <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Article_Stubs\" title=\"Category:Article Stubs\">page</a> is in need of information.</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-mbox\" style=\"display:block\">Can you help out? <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/The_Flaming_Red_from_Tomorrow?action=edit\">Click here to add more.</a></div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-mbox\" title=\"Dismiss\" style=\"color:#bbb;right:0;cursor:pointer;font-size:16px;top:0;transition:all .15s ease-in;position:absolute;padding:2px 7px;font-weight:bold\"></span></div></div></div>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-stacked\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">The Flaming Red from Tomorrow</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/9/9d/The_Flaming_Red_from_Tomorrow.png/revision/latest?cb=20260509102843\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"The Flaming Red from Tomorrow\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/9/9d/The_Flaming_Red_from_Tomorrow.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20260509102843\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/9/9d/The_Flaming_Red_from_Tomorrow.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20260509102843 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/9/9d/The_Flaming_Red_from_Tomorrow.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20260509102843 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"The Flaming Red from Tomorrow\" width=\"270\" height=\"132\" data-image-key=\"The_Flaming_Red_from_Tomorrow.png\" data-image-name=\"The Flaming Red from Tomorrow.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Quest Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Main_Quests\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Main Quests\">Main</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"chapter\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Chapter</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Chapter_III\" title=\"Chapter III\">Chapter III</a>: Segue</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"description\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Description</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">After the Dark Side incident comes to an end, Lucilla meets with Hiyuki at the auditorium. Lucilla suspects that the Fractsidus may be plotting something far more dangerous behind the scenes...</div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"prev\">Previous Quest</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next Quest</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"prev\"><a href=\"/wiki/Rabbit_Reflected_in_Shades\" title=\"Rabbit Reflected in Shades\">Rabbit Reflected in Shades</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wishes_in_the_Bell\" title=\"Wishes in the Bell\">Wishes in the Bell</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tRewards\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tCharacters\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"rewards\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"card-list-container\"><div class=\"card-container\"><span class=\"card-body\"><span class=\"card-image-container card-rarity-5\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Union_EXP\" title=\"Union EXP\"><img alt=\"Union EXP\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"74\" height=\"74\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Item Union EXP.png\" data-image-key=\"Item_Union_EXP.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/0/0b/Item_Union_EXP.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/74?cb=20240525121935\" /></a></span></span><span class=\"card-text card-font\"> 1,000</span></span></div><div class=\"card-container\"><span class=\"card-body\"><span class=\"card-image-container card-rarity-5\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Astrite\" title=\"Astrite\"><img alt=\"Astrite\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"74\" height=\"74\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Item Astrite.png\" data-image-key=\"Item_Astrite.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/1/16/Item_Astrite.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/74?cb=20240523021541\" /></a></span></span><span class=\"card-text card-font\"> 100</span></span></div><div class=\"card-container\"><span class=\"card-body\"><span class=\"card-image-container card-rarity-4\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advanced_Sealed_Tube\" title=\"Advanced Sealed Tube\"><img alt=\"Advanced Sealed Tube\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"74\" height=\"74\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Item Advanced Sealed Tube.png\" data-image-key=\"Item_Advanced_Sealed_Tube.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/d/d6/Item_Advanced_Sealed_Tube.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/74?cb=20240529094344\" /></a></span></span><span class=\"card-text card-font\"> 4</span></span></div><div class=\"card-container\"><span class=\"card-body\"><span class=\"card-image-container card-rarity-4\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advanced_Resonance_Potion\" title=\"Advanced Resonance Potion\"><img alt=\"Advanced Resonance Potion\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"74\" height=\"74\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Item Advanced Resonance Potion.png\" data-image-key=\"Item_Advanced_Resonance_Potion.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/e/e2/Item_Advanced_Resonance_Potion.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/74?cb=20240524152949\" /></a></span></span><span class=\"card-text card-font\"> 4</span></span></div><div class=\"card-container\"><span class=\"card-body\"><span class=\"card-image-container card-rarity-3\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shell_Credit\" title=\"Shell Credit\"><img alt=\"Shell Credit\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"74\" height=\"74\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Item Shell Credit.png\" data-image-key=\"Item_Shell_Credit.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/d/d1/Item_Shell_Credit.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/74?cb=20240523132525\" /></a></span></span><span class=\"card-text card-font\"> 60,000</span></span></div><div class=\"card-container\"><span class=\"card-body\"><span class=\"card-image-container card-rarity-4\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Modding_EXP\" title=\"Modding EXP\"><img alt=\"Modding EXP\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"74\" height=\"74\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Item Modding EXP.png\" data-image-key=\"Item_Modding_EXP.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/5/5d/Item_Modding_EXP.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/74?cb=20251229110008\" /></a></span></span><span class=\"card-text card-font\"> 1,600</span></span></div></span></div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"characters\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hiyuki\" title=\"Hiyuki\">Hiyuki</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Lucilla\" title=\"Lucilla\">Lucilla</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<b>The Flaming Red from Tomorrow</b> is a segue act in <a href=\"/wiki/Chapter_III\" title=\"Chapter III\">Chapter III</a> of the <a href=\"/wiki/Main_Quest\" title=\"Main Quest\">Main Quest</a>.\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Steps\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Steps</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Gameplay_Notes\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gameplay Notes</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Dialogue\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Dialogue</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Other_Languages\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Other Languages</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Change_History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Change History</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Navigation\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Navigation</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Steps\">Steps</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ol><li>Wait until the next day...</li>\n<li>Head to the auditorium</li></ol>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gameplay_Notes\">Gameplay Notes</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Completing the quest awards the <i><a href=\"/wiki/Rover%27s_Journey_III\" title=\"Rover&#39;s Journey III\">Rover's Journey III</a></i> <a href=\"/wiki/Trophy\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Trophy\">Trophy</a> <i><a href=\"/wiki/The_Danger_Within\" title=\"The Danger Within\">The Danger Within</a></i>.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Dialogue\">Dialogue</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"dialogue\">\n<dl><dt><b>Head to the auditorium</b></dt>\n<dd><b>Lucilla:</b> It's just the two of us now. No need for all the formality, Hiyuki.</dd>\n<dd><b>Lucilla:</b> Oh, and just so you know, the maintenance fee for that blade will be coming out of your paycheck this month.</dd>\n<dd><b>Hiyuki:</b> Which blade?</dd>\n<dd><b>Lucilla:</b> The one you used in the Dark Side. That makes it the fourth you've broken so far. Try to be gentler the next time, will you?</dd>\n<dd><b>Hiyuki:</b> Sure. What about my own sword?</dd>\n<dd><b>Lucilla:</b> Its maintenance is mostly done. Don't worry, you'll have it back soon.</dd>\n<dd><b>Lucilla:</b> Want to try one? It's pretty popular among the students.</dd>\n<dd><b>Hiyuki:</b> Not hungry.</dd>\n<dd><b>Lucilla:</b> Candy's supposed to be eaten when you're not hungry. That's what makes it taste good. Go on, try it.</dd>\n<dd><b>Lucilla:</b> Have you swallowed it?</dd>\n<dd><b>Hiyuki:</b> Umm-hmm. A bit sour… and my tongue's tingling. Not my favorite.</dd>\n<dd><b>Lucilla:</b> Huh? No reaction at all? That's odd. When Sigrika and the others ate theirs, they…</dd>\n<dd><b>Hiyuki:</b> What?</dd>\n<dd><b>Lucilla:</b> You're no fun.</dd>\n<dd><b>Hiyuki:</b> <span>(&#8205;&#8205;<span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed wuwa-collapsible\" data-tt-text=\"He\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed custom-tt toggle-tooltip\">He</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content custom-tt\" style=\"display:none\">Text for male Rover</span></span>&#8205;/<wbr />&#8205;<span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed wuwa-collapsible\" data-tt-text=\"She\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed custom-tt toggle-tooltip\">She</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content custom-tt\" style=\"display:none\">Text for female Rover</span></span>&#8205;&#8205;)</span> saw me. Does that affect your plan?</dd>\n<dd><b>Lucilla:</b> It's fine. The Fractsidus didn't just set the trap for me. It was meant to draw you out as well.</dd>\n<dd><b>Lucilla:</b> They've noticed your existence.</dd>\n<dd><b>Lucilla:</b> I'm sorry for keeping you confined… for trying to hide your power. In the end, it still came to light.</dd>\n<dd><b>Hiyuki:</b> We both knew this day would come sooner or later.</dd>\n<dd><b>Lucilla:</b> So… would you consider moving back to the Academy for now? If anything happens, you can respond right away.</dd>\n<dd><b>Lucilla:</b> The Fractsidus went to great lengths to tamper with the Dark Side, but it poses little actual threat to the Academy.</dd>\n<dd><b>Lucilla:</b> At worst, this anomaly might be tied to the power of the Threnodian, too. It seems they're already preparing their next phase.</dd>\n<dd><b>Hiyuki:</b> What do you need me to do?</dd>\n<dd><b>Lucilla:</b> Now's not the time.</dd>\n<dd><b>Lucilla:</b> You should know that the Spacetrek Collective was built atop the Threnodian. That's why we've prepared countless contingency plans.</dd>\n<dd><b>Lucilla:</b> Even if every single one failed… even if the Threnodian completely consumed the Collective, we still have a final card to play.</dd>\n<dd><b>Lucilla:</b> The wish-granting miko, you—</dd>\n<dt><b>(Quest Complete)</b></dt></dl>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Other_Languages\">Other Languages</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"article-table alternating-colors-table\"><tbody><tr><th>Language</th><th>Official Name</th></tr><tr><td><b><span class=\"flag\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Emoji EN Flag\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/f/f5/Emoji_EN_Flag.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/19?cb=20240529221541\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Emoji EN Flag.png\" data-image-key=\"Emoji_EN_Flag.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></span></span></span>&#160;&#160;English</b></td><td>The Flaming Red from Tomorrow</td></tr><tr><td style=\"line-height:1em\"><b><span class=\"flag\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Emoji ZHS Flag\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/5/5f/Emoji_ZHS_Flag.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/19?cb=20240529221618\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Emoji ZHS Flag.png\" data-image-key=\"Emoji_ZHS_Flag.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></span></span></span>&#160;&#160;Chinese <abbr title=\"Simplified\"><small>(S)</small></abbr></b></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hans\">明日摇曳的绯影</span></td></tr></tbody></table> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Change_History\">Change History</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"change-history\"><div class=\"change-history-header\"><div>Released in <b><a href=\"/wiki/Version/3.2\" title=\"Version/3.2\">Version 3.2</a></b></div><div>[<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/The_Flaming_Red_from_Tomorrow/Change_History?action=edit&amp;preload=Template:Change_History/Preload&amp;preloadparams%5b%5d=3.2&amp;preloadparams%5b%5d=The+Flaming+Red+from+Tomorrow\">Create New History</a>]</div></div></div><div style=\"clear:both; margin:0; padding:0;\"></div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Navigation\">Navigation</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"navbox-border navbox\" style=\"border-spacing:0;;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:2px;\"><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"nowraplinks hlist mw-collapsible navbox-inner\" style=\"border-spacing:0;background:transparent;color:inherit;;\"><tbody><tr><th style=\";\" colspan=\"2\" class=\"navbox-title\"><div class=\"hidden\" style=\"flo